@startuml mcp-proxy-business-activity
!theme plain
title mcp-proxy 业务活动图（云手机 sandbox 全生命周期）

|用户 Agent|
start
:获取 10s 临时 token\n(E1 /api/token/issue);
:订阅实例 CreateInstance;
|mcp-proxy|
:校验 token，INSERT 实例\nstatus=CREATED（MySQL）;
:BatchPrepareInstances\nstatus=PREPARING, waitingCount=3;
|用户 Agent|
repeat
  :轮询 ShowProgress;
  |mcp-proxy|
  :waitingCount--;
repeat while (waitingCount > 0?) is (yes)

:E4 fetchAccessInfo\n取云机 ip + mcp_port 落库;
:GET /healthz 判活;
if (healthz 2xx?) then ( alive )
  :status=NORMAL\nhealthy=true;
else ( dead )
  :status=FAILED\nhealthy=false;
  stop
endif

|用户 Agent|
:login 换 30min JWT（RS256）;
|mcp-proxy|
:远程校验 token，私钥签发 JWT;
|用户 Agent|
repeat
  :发起 MCP 请求\n（HTTP / SSE / WS 三选一）;
  |mcp-proxy|
  if (JWT 有效且 instanceId 匹配?) then ( no )
    :401 / 403;
    stop
  else ( yes )
  endif
  if (实例就绪且归属本人?) then ( no )
    :404 / 409;
    stop
  else ( yes )
  endif
  if (Redis 路由缓存命中?) then ( yes )
    :续期 TTL=30min;
  else ( no )
    :读 MySQL（无则 E4 获取落库）\n回填缓存;
  endif
  :携带用户 JWT 转发云机;
  |云手机 mcp-server|
  :预置公钥验签;
  :执行工具（tap/adb_shell/...）;
  |mcp-proxy|
  :透传响应;
  |用户 Agent|
  if (任务完成?) then ( no )
  else ( yes )
  endif
repeat while (继续操控?) is (yes) not (no)

|mcp-proxy|
note right
  并行后台任务：每 30s 对活跃实例
  （长连接存续或 3min 内有请求）
  调 healthz，更新 healthy
end note

|用户 Agent|
:DeleteInstance 退订;
|mcp-proxy|
:status=DELETED（逻辑删除）\n清除 Redis 路由缓存;
stop
@enduml
